{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2001年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：癸酉年、丙辰月、己未日、丙子时。日主己土生于辰月，得月干丙火生扶，身旺。2001年为辛巳年，命主8岁（虚岁9岁），行大运乙卯（约5-15岁）。流年辛巳，天干辛金为食神，地支巳火为印星。\n\n分析事件：辛巳年，辛金食神透出，主表达、才艺、口才；巳火为印星，主学业、文书、名誉。食神与印星相合（辛金与丙火暗合），且巳火与月支辰土、日支未土有火土相生之势，利于学业表现和才艺展示。原局时柱丙子，子水为财，被巳火冲（子巳暗合但亦有冲意），但流年巳火为印，印星旺而制伤官（原局无伤官，但子水为偏财，被冲可能主变动，但结合食神透出，更偏向于正面事件）。\n\n选项B“参与小话剧演讲比赛获奖”符合食神透干、印星生扶的组合，代表口才、表演、荣誉。其他选项如霸凌（官杀克身）、遗传病（印星过旺或五行失衡）、交通意外（冲克严重）均与流年干支组合不符。因此，最可能为B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_0_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5329, "response_id": "3581bccd-22bb-4756-99ba-d93819ed3105", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 321, "total_tokens": 548, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
